WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:06.983
A giant pile of photos, and Maya has to look at every single one to sort them!

3
00:00:07.477 --> 00:00:10.743
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:13.560
This is Episode 88.

5
00:00:14.053 --> 00:00:15.881
Meet the seeing eye.

6
00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.085
Show it a photo.

7
00:00:18.579 --> 00:00:21.468
It looks, and tells you what is inside.

8
00:00:21.962 --> 00:00:23.377
A lemon!

9
00:00:23.871 --> 00:00:25.239
A dog!

10
00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:27.125
A boat!

11
00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:29.587
It never gets tired.

12
00:00:30.081 --> 00:00:31.720
Blurry photo?

13
00:00:32.214 --> 00:00:35.056
It looks closer, and still knows.

14
00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.661
Three things in one photo?

15
00:00:38.155 --> 00:00:40.030
It spots all three.

16
00:00:40.524 --> 00:00:43.838
Maya just holds them up, and the eye does the looking.

17
00:00:44.331 --> 00:00:46.831
That is Amazon Rekognition.

18
00:00:47.325 --> 00:00:51.087
It looks at pictures and videos, and tells you what is in them.

19
00:00:51.581 --> 00:00:53.621
Now you know the seeing eye!

20
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

